      "id": "claim_bb4cb6fd34e74e2897bb97629fbf5810",
      "statement": "All three subcommands are runnable with no API key out of the box because --config defaults to config/config.example.yaml, which selects the mock provider, while --out defaults to ./workdir/out; --enrich applies to `parse` and to `run` over a raw folder, and --force applies to `parse` only.",
